# Workout Tracker App

A full-stack workout tracking application. **Work in progress.**

## Tech Stack

**Backend**
- Python / FastAPI
- SQLAlchemy + SQLite
- JWT authentication (python-jose)
- bcrypt password hashing

**Frontend**
- React + Vite
- React Router
- Zustand (global state)
- Axios (API calls)
- Recharts (progress charts — planned)

## Project Structure
workout-tracker-backend/
app/
models/          Database models (User, Workout)
routes/          API endpoints (auth, workouts)
schemas/         Pydantic request/response schemas
api/             Axios instance + interceptors
auth.py          Password hashing + JWT logic
database.py      SQLAlchemy setup
main.py          App entry point

workout-tracker-frontend/
src/
api/             Axios API helpers + shared instance
components/      Shared components (Navbar)
pages/           Page components (Dashboard, Login, Register, LogWorkout)
store/           Zustand global auth state

## Setup

**Backend**
```bash
cd workout-tracker-backend
pip install -r requirements.txt
uvicorn app.main:app --reload

**Frontend**
cd workout-tracker-frontend
npm install
npm run dev
API runs on http://localhost:8000

Frontend runs on http://localhost:5173

API docs at http://localhost:8000/docs

Features
 User registration and login
 JWT authentication with expiry handling
 Protected routes (redirect to /login if unauthenticated)
 Log workouts (exercise, sets, reps, weight)
 Dashboard with workout history
 Progress charts
 Styling